# Docker build context for the app images (apps/*/Dockerfile, context = repo root).
# Secrets must never enter the context: every .env file is excluded below.

# Dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/out
**/dist
**/build
**/.vercel
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.playwright-mcp

# Env files and keys: runtime env lives in Coolify (CLAUDE.md rule 10)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# VCS, editors, agents
.git
.github
**/.DS_Store
.claude
.cursor
.cursorrules
.agents
.superpowers
.planning
skills-lock.json

# Large folders not needed to build an app
Marketing Videos
Tutorial Videos
brag-output*
reference
.editions-inbox
state
scripts/perf-work
scripts/perf
docs
*.png
!apps/**/*.png
!packages/**/*.png
*.md
!apps/**/*.md
!packages/**/*.md
